  "releaseNotes": "Preview 6 improves ordered keyed batches, WAL/frame encoding, checkpoint allocation and CRC paths while preserving flush, validation and recovery boundaries. Adds bounded IDB5 metadata preservation, validated detached updates and durable-commit reporting. Preview 5 cannot read IDB5 writes; retain a pre-upgrade backup. Performance is workload-dependent; see the dated results for wins and regressions.",
